DEF ADA4528 U 0 0 Y N 1 F N
F0 "U" 150 100 50 H V C CNN
F1 "ADA4528" 150 -250 50 H V C CNN
F2 "" 150 0 50 H I C CNN
F3 "" 250 100 50 H I C CNN
$FPLIST
 DIP*W7.62mm*
$ENDFPLIST
DRAW
T 0 80 -25 31 0 0 0 NC Normal 0 C C
T 0 -150 -100 50 0 0 1 + Normal 1 C C
T 0 -150 100 50 0 0 1 - Normal 1 C C
P 2 0 1 0 -100 -200 -100 -150 N
P 2 0 1 0 -100 200 -100 150 N
P 2 0 1 0 100 -50 100 -100 N
P 2 0 1 0 200 -100 100 -100 N
P 4 0 1 10 200 0 -200 -200 -200 200 200 0 f
X INV.INPUT 2 -300 100 100 R 50 50 1 1 I
X NOT-INV.INPUT 3 -300 -100 100 R 50 50 1 1 I
X V- 4 -100 -300 100 U 50 50 1 1 W
X NC 5 300 -100 100 L 50 50 1 1 P
X OUTPUT 6 300 0 100 L 50 50 1 1 O
X V+ 7 -100 300 100 D 50 50 1 1 W
ENDDRAW
ENDDEF
